units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
region target block 0 20 0 20 20 60 units lattice
region gap block 0 20 0 20 19.5 20 units lattice
create_box 2 all
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 2 region target
region full block 0 20 0 20 0 60 units lattice
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 5
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 50000
unfix 1
velocity projectile set 0 0 2000 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
run 100000
